{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/cleanup.gif?t=1743513723\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destroy evidence, leave no trace </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You've received another job, it pays well but something's not right. Pack up the truck and head to the location - Your task is to <i>clean up</i> the <i>accident</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't leave anything behind, not even your footsteps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Watch your step</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's plenty of Hazards, tread carefully and try not to get yourself killed - Your employer, IPT is closely watching. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who are you working for</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover what exactly you're covering up in this dark, puzzle mystery. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2692620?t=1743513723","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2692620?t=1743513723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743513723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743513723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is cartoon blood and unique ways to destroy evidence, including bodies."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2924270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/cleanup.gif?t=